ATTRIBUTION NOTE:
The Vocal Rise Time (VRT) algorithm in this package is an original
implementation inspired by the VOAT toolbox (Arias-Vergara et al., 2024,
SoftwareX, DOI: 10.1016/j.softx.2024.101802). VOAT is licensed under
Apache License 2.0 / GPL v3+. This implementation does not copy VOAT
source code; it reimplements the described energy-based VAD + RMS
envelope approach independently.